  "description": "DAO-QUERY: a dynaset is opened on QParam with pId = 2 and read. pId is set to 3, then Requery() with no argument; rows are read. pId is set to 4, then Requery(QueryDef object); rows are read. Then Requery('QParam'), Requery(Empty), Requery(Null) and Requery(QSel object), each followed by rows and Errors. Restartable is read first.",
